    "open_status": "Clinch/Drescher/Huynh/Saffidine2024/ALENEX2025 and reviewed current records give constructions not finite30 optimality. DiMichele/Forbes INFORMS2025 proves16=37; that closed instance is excluded. Asymptotic bounds with sufficiently-large hypotheses are not applied to30.",
    "independent_method": "Root reconstructs occupied row,column,sum-diagonal,difference-diagonal sets, and proves opposite-color line-label sets disjoint. Formal checker independently enumerates all cross-color pairs. Finite rook bound225 follows from min(rc,(30-r)(30-c))<=225; no conditional asymptotic bound.",
